          "line": 76,
          "message": "The RELEASE-ID-06 baseline matches only the Terraform file basename and block name. Match the path relative to infra/terraform so a new nested file cannot reuse a baseline entry and evade the indirect-assignment check.",
          "confidence": 0.91,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "Role_assignments_use_only_direct_resource_references reduces each Terraform path to its basename at line 68, then compares that basename and the block name against ExistingIndirectGrants.",
            "failureScenario": "If a new nested file such as examples/main.tf declares an indirect role assignment named terraform_contributor, its basename and block name match the main.tf baseline entry, so the test skips it. The AC RELEASE-ID-06 scan can pass despite an indirect assignment outside the baseline."
          }
        }
